# RSVP Application Environment Configuration

## Database Mode
# Set DB_MODE to 'remote' for Turso or 'local' for local SQLite file

### Remote (Turso) — requires valid TURSO_URL and TURSO_AUTH_TOKEN
# DB_MODE=remote
# TURSO_URL=libsql://your-database.turso.io
# TURSO_AUTH_TOKEN=your-auth-token

### Local SQLite — creates/uses local.db in project root
# DB_MODE=local

## Email (Resend)
# RESEND_API_KEY=re_...

## Admin Dashboard Password
# ADMIN_PASSWORD=your-password
